#: ui/app.slint:755
msgctxt "AppWindow"
msgid ""
"Android 13 in a container, straight on Linux: ~1.2 GB per device, against "
"~4.5 GB for the emulator. Needs Docker and binder in the kernel. Hibernating "
"shuts it down and keeps apps and accounts on disk."
msgstr "Android 13 em contêiner, direto no Linux: ~1,2 GB por aparelho, contra ~4,5 GB do emulador. Pede o Docker e o binder no kernel. Hibernar desliga e guarda os apps e as contas no disco."

